  "steps": [
    "Heat 1 tsp olive oil in a pan and add the chopped garlic. Sauté until fragrant.",
    "Add the Thai red curry paste and cook briefly.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and around 100ml water. Mix well and bring to a boil.",
    "Add salt and the zero calorie sweetener. Stir well.",
    "Add the boiled corn and shirataki noodles. Cover and cook for 7 to 8 minutes until the sauce reduces.",
    "Add the bok choy leaves, cover and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, grate the tofu.",
    "Heat 1 tsp olive oil in a separate pan. Add the grated tofu and pan fry on both sides until golden brown.",
    "Add the gochujang sauce and cook for another 4 to 5 minutes, stirring to coat the tofu.",
    "Stirfry brocolli and mushroom with pepper and salt in a spray of oil.",
    "Assemble the bowl and dig in."
  ],
